      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Farrelly Southern are delighted to present 16 The Lawn, Moyglare Abbey, Maynooth to the market. This spacious four-bedroom semi-detached family home occupies an excellent position within this highly sought-after and established development, enjoying a particularly attractive outlook over a large green area to the front.\nOne of the standout features of No. 16 is the extension to the rear, which provides valuable additional living space and gives the property a larger overall footprint than many of the standard four-bedroom homes within the development. The extended accommodation offers excellent flexibility for modern family living and is a significant advantage for purchasers seeking additional space.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and spacious, with well-proportioned living area, guest wc, kitchen/dining/living area and utility room. Access to the rear garden from the kitchen area and utility room. Upstairs, there are four generous sized bedrooms, making this an ideal home for a growing family, those working from home.\n\nExternally, No. 16 enjoys an enviable setting. To the front, the property overlooks a substantial landscaped green, providing an attractive open aspect and an excellent amenity for families. To the rear is a private garden together with a block-built shed and a sunny aspect patio area. \n\nMoyglare Abbey is a mature and highly regarded residential development situated within easy reach of Maynooth town centre, Maynooth University and a wide range of local amenities.\nMaynooth offers an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, sporting clubs and leisure facilities. Maynooth town is particularly well served by public transport, with regular rail and bus services providing convenient access to Dublin. The property also benefits from easy access to the M4 motorway and wider motorway network, making the location an excellent choice for commuters while retaining all the advantages of living within a thriving university town.\n\nDont miss out on this property - Book to view today!\n\nDisclaimer: We have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties should undertake their own investigations regarding the condition and working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs and floor plans are provided for guidance purposes only.\n\nFEATURES:\nSpacious 4 bedroom semi-detached family home\nGas fired central heating \nBuilt 1998\nBER C\nExtended kitchen/dining living area \nSuperb position overlooking a large green area\nWell-proportioned accommodation throughout\nPrivate rear garden with sunny patio area \nBlock-built shed\nMature and highly sought-after residential development\nConvenient to Maynooth town centre and Maynooth University\nExcellent public transport and road networks \n\n"
      },
      {
